<title>ShieldVerify Dashboard | EdgeIQ Labs</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0a0f;
    --card: #12121a;
    --border: #1e1e2e;
    --accent: #3dd9ff;
    --success: #00ff66;
